## User

Check whether a list reads the same forwards and backwards.

## Type

type
```haskell
isPalindrome :: Eq a => [a] -> Bool
```

## Term

```haskell
isPalindrome [] = True
isPalindrome [x] = True
isPalindrome (x:xs) = x == last xs && isPalindrome (init xs)
```

